      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s06-b1",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "So it began. One day it was fish from the stream. The next day it was honey from the rocks. The Tortoise brought figs, and that took him from dawn to dark."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-b2",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "The valley was quiet now. But was the Lion pleased? He was not."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-b3",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "“More!”",
              "say": "lion",
              "chip": true
            },
            {
              "t": " he grumbled from his den. "
            },
            {
              "t": "“Bigger! Sooner!”",
              "say": "lion"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-b4",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "And each day he said it a little louder."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "part": "part-1",
      "scene": {
        "unfolded": {
          "file": "art/scene-council.unfolded.heic",
